Subject: IR3 Runner Refusal Expected Ledger
Date: 2026-05-26

& [ExpectedRunnerRefusalLedger: IR3OperatorHarness] is the expected refusal ledger for blocked or stale fixture cases
  + [fixture_id] is stale_authority_input_refusal
  + [expected_outcome_kind] is blocked_output
  + [expected_refusal_reason] is stale_refusal
  + [expected_success_output_present] is false
  + [fixture_id] is missing_contract_version_refusal
  + [expected_outcome_kind] is blocked_output
  + [expected_refusal_reason] is missing_contract_version
  + [expected_success_output_present] is false
  + [fixture_id] is unsupported_scope_refusal
  + [expected_outcome_kind] is blocked_output
  + [expected_refusal_reason] is unsupported_scope
  + [expected_success_output_present] is false
  + [fixture_id] is generated_output_path_escape_refusal
  + [expected_outcome_kind] is blocked_output
  + [expected_refusal_reason] is generated_output_path_escape
  + [expected_success_output_present] is false
  + [fixture_id] is source_mutation_refusal
  + [expected_outcome_kind] is blocked_output
  + [expected_refusal_reason] is source_mutation_refusal
  + [expected_success_output_present] is false

  = must: require operator_trace for every refusal
  = must: require non_authority_warning on every refusal trace
